  "published": "2025-06-09T07:43:37.55Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "_New_\n- `ChapterInfo` has a new `Format` property that explains which internal format the chapter was taken from (QT, Nero or Native)\n_Changed_\n- APE tag : Doesn't classify any field with 1000+ bytes as an embedded picture anymore, which allows to read those gigantic titles, comments and acoustic fingerprints (thanks to @MusicMoveArr)\n- ID3v2 : Read and edit data from \"illegal\" ID3v2 tags (e.g. inside MP4/M4A files which aren't compatible)\nNB : Tagging incompatible files with ID3v2 still isn't and won't be supported\n_Fixed_\n- Int overflow when parsing track numbers with gigantic values (e.g. 9784547879)\n- Wrongly detecting a string with numbers separated by a '-' as a signed numeric (e.g. \"337-448\")\n***Binaries are available from nuGet***",
  "repository": "",
